ter\">You can also create your own custom character to team up alongside using the .vrm file format!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/05ad4980da5f8e09ed3c0e9d808a5ffa.poster.avif?t=1762571203\" width=358 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/05ad4980da5f8e09ed3c0e9d808a5ffa.webm?t=1762571203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/05ad4980da5f8e09ed3c0e9d808a5ffa.mp4?t=1762571203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Converse with your allies in the &quot;Winry Mystery Mansion&quot; hub world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game supports Keyboard + Mouse, and Controller</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Extra Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Original Soundtrack by: Daniel Redstone</strong></p>",
